e bigger amounts, honestly, so which of those people owe me more than twenty?\", \"Oh, and before I forget, could you send Jonas a message saying happy birthday? I'd feel awful if it slipped my mind.\"], [\"umm can you add the table picture to the, uh, the Starfish album?\", \"ok and which album's it in now?\", \"oh and, um, who owes me money at the moment?\", \"right so which of those are, like, above twenty?\", \"oh and can you send Jonas a message saying, uh, happy birthday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0023\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me which tasks are due on tuesday, please?\", \"And what about this week?\", \"Please mark the second one as done and delete the third one.\", \"Thank you. And could you show me this week as well?\"], [\"tasks due tuesday?\", \"and this week?\", \"tick off second, delete third\", \"this week again?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0024\", \"v\": [[\"who do I still owe?\", \"pics with any of them?\"], [\"I've borrowed from a few people lately and honestly lost track, so who do I still need to pay back?\", \"Actually, it'd be nice to send them something friendly when I settle up. Have I got any pictures with any of those people in them?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0025\", \"v\": [[\"delete the Florentyna note\", \"anything mentioning Sigrid?\", \"in my to-do list too?\", \"Lannara's debts?\", \"Tirani. what events are they coming to?\", \"second to thursday, fourth to tuesday\"], [\"can u delete the Florentyna note pls\", \"diff thing, show me everything that mentions Sigrid\", \"is it in my to-do list as well\", \"also show me Lannara's debts\", \"the Tirani one, what events r they coming to\", \"move the second one to thursday and the fourth one to tuesday pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0026\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you delete the, uh, the club questions note?\", \"oh and which contact's my, um, my electrician?\"], [\"delete the club questions note pls\", \"also which contact is my electrician\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0027\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please delete the cushion note?\", \"Also, would you mind finding my library login for me?\", \"Thank you. Could you tell me which tasks are still open, please?\"], [\"pls delete the cushion note\", \"diff thing, can u find the library login\", \"and which tasks r still open\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0028\", \"v\": [[\"umm what were the, uh, football scores from the weekend?\"], [\"I missed every single match because I was busy with family stuff, so could you tell me the football scores from the weekend?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0029\", \"v\": [[\"subtasks of check the post (wk 53)?\", \"both to sunday\", \"add umbrella close-up to Portree 2026 album\", \"wrong photo, the bouldering one\"], [\"what are the subtasks for check the post (wk 53)\", \"move both of them to sunday pls\", \"also add the umbrella close-up pic to the Portree 2026 album\", \"no wait wrong pic, i meant the bouldering one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0031\", \"v\": [[\"which album is the sailcloth photo in\", \"whats else in that album\"], [\"um which album's the, uh, the sailcloth photo in?\", \"ok and what else is in that one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0032\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to get organised for the next game night, so could you pull up everything that mentions rummy?\", \"I usually scribble my planning down rather than anything else, so what about in my notes?\", \"I think I filed a couple under my other hobby, so could you show just the ones in the Bagpipes notebook?\", \"Hang on, before I forget, I need to log in later. What are the pickleball club portal details?\", \"Ok, back to the rummy stuff. I have a feeling I paid for something last time, so is there anything in my expenses about it too?\"], [\"Could you show me everything that mentions rummy, please?\", \"And what about in my notes?\", \"Could you show me only the ones in the Bagpipes notebook, please?\", \"Sorry, quick question: could you tell me what the pickleball club portal details are?\", \"Thank you. Going back to the rummy things, is there anything in my expenses about it as well?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0033\", \"v\": [[\"Portree trip: how much spent?\"], [\"I'm trying to work out whether we blew the budget, so for the Portree trip, how much have I actually spent altogether?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0034\", \"v\": [[\"umm what've I, uh, what have I spent on in the Portree trip?\"], [\"Someone asked me what we splurged on and I honestly couldn't remember, so could you show me what I've spent on in the Portree trip?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0035\", \"v\": [[\"It came out really blurry and it's been bugging me, so could you delete my ivy photo?\", \"Different thing. I jotted some stuff down for Magnus somewhere, so where's that ask magnus of mine?\", \"I can't remember what else I stuck in there, so what else is in that notebook?\", \"Hang on, I'll need to get online when I'm there. What's the Café Corbridge wifi?\", \"Oh wait, another quick one. I'm trying to settle up with everyone, so how much does Giacomo owe me in bagpipes gang?\"], [\"pls delete my ivy photo\", \"diff thing, wheres my ask magnus\", \"whats else in that notebook\", \"hang on whats the Café Corbridge wifi\", \"wait also how much does Giacomo owe me in bagpipes gang\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0036\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please delete the musholm common appointment?\", \"Oh, I'm sorry, I didn't mean that. Could you bring it back, please?\", \"Also, could you tell me how much Lannara Tirani owes me in lastet fund?\"], [\"delete the musholm common appt pls\", \"oops didnt mean that, put it back\", \"also how much does Lannara Tirani owe me in lastet fund\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0037\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what Omar's balance with me is in the bagpipes gang group, please?\"], [\"whats Omar's balance w me in bagpipes gang\"]]}","ttft_ms":31504,"type":"result","duration_ms":47554,"uuid":"9f663f28-d874-49df-81a9-7c0cd7725219","ttft_stream_ms":1537,"time_to_request_ms":166,"first_content_frame_ms":1537,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22120050,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"ti